                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "722e3abc-2d56-4614-a85d-0b389f765b5e",
                                "sense_id": "21e6d73a-c223-3fac-8d30-08ce4ab102b5",
                                "text": "Jednym z najczęściej powtarzanych chwytów [Karola] Irzykowskiego [w: \"Beniaminek\"] jest podkreślanie przestarzałości stanowiska [Tadeusza] Boya[-Żeleńskiego] — to już było, powiedziano to wcześniej i lepiej.",
                                "translation": "One of the most frequently repeated ploys of [Karol] Irzykowski [in: \"Beniaminek\"] is to emphasise the obsolescence of the position of [Tadeusz] Boy[-Żeleński] — it already existed, it has been said before and better.",
                                "english": "One of the most frequently repeated ploys of [Karol] Irzykowski [in: \"Beniaminek\"] is to emphasise the obsolescence of the position of [Tadeusz] Boy[-Żeleński] — it already existed, it has been said before and better."
